Snail mail will be much faster at reaching me.  Or send stuff to dstalder
on this list, since he is serviong as a local drop for me.

On using Lojban on the net. I encourage it greatly, but I ask that you
a. send an English transllation along with it, since most people do not
   use good Lojban yet.
b. If you can make sure I get a copy, then I will read it for 'goodness'.
   I may not have time to comment, though.

If you comment on someone else's grammar or usage, it is also probably best to
give me a copy, too.  That way I can correct erroneous corrections.

While I cannot respond to everything, I will READ everything.  If I can 
reasonably respond, I will. But we all want the language done more.

